# Site Essentials (Cursor mirror of rules/08-site-essentials.md)

> Canonical source: `rules/08-site-essentials.md`. If they differ, canonical wins.

Every build ships **ALL FIVE** — part of Definition of Done:

1. Favicon — `/favicon.ico` + SVG icon + apple-touch icon (framework metadata-file conventions).
2. Privacy policy — `/privacy` page, linked in footer (placeholder content flagged for user review).
3. Terms & conditions — `/terms` page, linked in footer (placeholder content flagged for user review).
4. Sitemap — `/sitemap.xml` generated from real routes + `robots.txt` referencing it.
5. Share preview — OG + `twitter:card` metadata on every public page; `og:image` 1200×630.

Rules:

- Native framework mechanisms only — NO `next-seo`, `react-helmet`, sitemap generator libs.
- Page UI via Astryx/shadcn — never hand-rolled.
- Never fabricate legal text — mark placeholders clearly for user review.
- Verify each essential (page source, curl sitemap, share debugger) and report status in your response.
